{"unit_id":"harmless0819-dev__dsh-persona-anchor#caveat-1","repo":"harmless0819-dev/dsh-persona-anchor","commit":"2ca773fb709eee2a451ef8a268eddb4c17f99bf1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona-anchor 使用前须知：必须配置人设文件的绝对路径；默认单次读取上限为 512 KiB，文件缺失、为空或超限会导致本次读取失败（见 lib/index.js:78-100,144-147）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:78-100","lib/index.js:144-147"]}
{"unit_id":"harmless0819-dev__dsh-persona-anchor#caveat-2","repo":"harmless0819-dev/dsh-persona-anchor","commit":"2ca773fb709eee2a451ef8a268eddb4c17f99bf1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona-anchor 使用前须知：启用状态路由时，响应包含当前人设文本的前 160 个字符；可将 route 设为 false 关闭路由（见 lib/index.js:220-230,239-240）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:220-230","lib/index.js:239-240"]}
